Just to keep the wider crowd informed:

We're currently discussing that we won't have any Audio miniconference 
on LPC (Linux Plumber's Conference) this year. Instead, we'll have an 
audio miniconference day in Edinburgh in October, colocated with 
LinuxCon Europe, Kernel Summit, ELCE and GStreamer conferences.

The exact day for this miniconference has not been decided yet.

The main reason for this move is proximity, as several participants are 
located in northern Europe.

